error BYN1008: a postfix `if` applies only to a simple statement

  2 │     { work() } if ok
    │                ^^
    │
  help: put the condition first: `if cond { … }`

error BYN1008: a postfix `if` applies only to a simple statement

  3 │     let x = 1 if ok
    │               ^^
    │
  help: declare the variable, then assign it conditionally; a declaration cannot be conditional
